				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1490,
				33
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Consolidate imports and reformat Rust code across core modules\n\nStandardize multi-line import blocks to use brace-compressed syntax in CertificateManager.rs. Apply consistent line-wrapping and removal of unnecessary vertical whitespace across the Environment provider modules, Command handlers, and Track effect handlers.\n\nThis change focuses purely on formatting and code style alignment. No functional logic, business rules, or error handling flows are altered. The modifications ensure uniform indentation and line length compliance (typically wrapping comments and long method chains at 100 characters) across the Mountain native backend codebase.\n\nThis improves readability and prepares the codebase for automated linting enforcement.",
			"SHA": "c8a486c1635ccee407de53db21f6127a3cce049b"
		}
